imple a  scientist by the name of ted salas  working on a secret chemical experiment  in the florida everglades is pursued by  bad guys seeking to steal the formula  the chase ends with salis crashing his  car into a swamp where mysterious forces  combined with the chemicals they've been  working on to permanently transform  salis into the bizarre entity known as  the man thing manthing is a slow moving  creature with a penchant for thwarting  various criminal schemes  despite the fact that he has very little  if any conscious mind left to speak of  gerber created the character's classic  tagline whoever knows fear burns at the  touch of the man thing the phrase  describes another of manthing's  abilities to sense and feed off of fear  and other emotions and nearby people  good people don't tend to fear man thing  as they senseate decency within him but  wrongdoers react with terror when they  do so his touch quite literally burns  their flesh manthing also plays a  shockingly prominent role in marvel's  multiverse because it turns out that the  everglades are the nexus of all  realities manthane is a guardian of that  nexus it's a no-brainer then that the  man thing would be part of the werewolf  by nightcast of characters the character  can prove to be highly significant to  the recently announced multiverse saga  of the marvel cinematic universe given  his role as guardian of the nexus with  mcu characters including spider-man and  doctor strange having already gotten  involved with various multiversal  entanglements the table for secret wars  is well on its way to being set the  multiverse  this had his theories he believed it was  real  and  dangerous furthermore some familiar  looking uniforms spotted in the werewolf  by night trailer indicate what might be  the time variance authority from loki  possibly hinting that manthing's extra  dimensional role may carry over to his  mcu incarnation with all this multiverse  stuff happening it just makes sense that  man thing would take up that mantle in  the mcu as well that's all speculation  though fans will have to wait until  october 7th when werewolf by night hits  disney plus to find out exactly how  manthing fits into the mcu
 

